<title>UK: Citibank sets warrants on Swiss single stocks.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on Swiss single stocks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank SA has issued 24 million American-style call warrants, in three tranches, on 10 million warrants on Credit Suisse Group, four million on Union Bank of Switzerland and 10 million on Swiss Bank Corp, lead manager Citibank (Switzerland) said.</p>
<p> WARRANTS	    STRIKE	   ISS PRICE     PREMIUM</p>
<p> CREDIT SUISSE	190.00 CHF    1.04 CHF	21.60 PCT</p>
<p> UBS		   1450.00 CHF    3.10 CHF	 9.10 PCT</p>
<p> SBC		    350.00 CHF    1.06 CHF	15.60 PCT</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   17.DEC.98		 PAYDATE	09.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
